WEBVTT

00:45.180 --> 00:47.220
Humanity through consuming potions

00:47.940 --> 00:50.340
harnessed various Beyonder abilities,

00:50.620 --> 00:53.380
completing their promotion to life's natural order.

00:54.900 --> 00:57.180
These twenty-two paths of advancement

00:57.580 --> 00:59.500
start from Sequence 9.

01:00.300 --> 01:02.140
The lower the Sequence number,

01:02.660 --> 01:04.940
the greater the Beyonder abilities.

01:06.180 --> 01:07.820
High-Sequence Beyonders

01:08.380 --> 01:11.540
can possess power comparable to gods.

01:12.580 --> 01:15.180
This path of evolution is called

01:16.180 --> 01:18.420
the Path of the Divine.

01:23.580 --> 01:23.620
Episode 10

01:23.580 --> 01:23.620
Clue

01:23.580 --> 01:23.620
It's not just money that's being cheated

02:34.540 --> 02:35.100
Klein.

02:35.500 --> 02:36.140
You're here!

02:57.780 --> 02:58.500
Mr. Neil.

02:59.060 --> 03:01.220
Aren't the invoices this time a little too much?

03:01.340 --> 03:02.340
How's it too much?

03:02.660 --> 03:03.820
There are just six!

03:04.100 --> 03:04.460
Go!

03:05.020 --> 03:05.500
What?

03:05.820 --> 03:06.900
The dirt on your shoes,

03:07.260 --> 03:08.660
hurry up and throw that out!

03:10.140 --> 03:11.140
Then it'd be better to just call it

03:11.580 --> 03:14.620
the Society for the Protection of Fantastic Organisms!

03:49.740 --> 03:50.300
Klein,

03:50.940 --> 03:51.660
there's a letter for you.

03:54.020 --> 03:54.500
Klein,

03:55.460 --> 03:56.980
by the time you see this letter

03:57.740 --> 03:59.020
I'll have already boarded the train

03:59.300 --> 04:00.420
to Backlund.

04:02.620 --> 04:04.660
The Inverted Maesoleum you mentioned last time

04:05.740 --> 04:06.940
feels familiar to me,

04:07.820 --> 04:08.660
but it's a pity

04:09.060 --> 04:10.340
that I can't remember any more.

04:11.940 --> 04:12.500
So,

04:12.980 --> 04:14.540
I intend to take a look around elsewhere.

04:15.180 --> 04:16.700
To see if I can find more memories.

04:18.140 --> 04:18.860
On the other hand,

04:19.540 --> 04:20.980
the person behind the curtain has made no moves.

04:21.660 --> 04:22.620
My leaving Tingen

04:23.020 --> 04:24.620
perhaps can make them loosen up.

04:26.620 --> 04:28.100
Mr. Azik has left too.

04:28.660 --> 04:29.580
What do we do from here on out?

04:30.380 --> 04:31.820
If the black hand behind the curtain moves again,

04:32.580 --> 04:33.580
relying on just myself...

04:42.140 --> 04:42.740
This is...

05:01.460 --> 05:02.060
What are you doing?

05:04.820 --> 05:05.260
Captain.

05:05.820 --> 05:06.900
This wanted order is――

05:08.020 --> 05:09.140
Did I not warn you before?

05:12.980 --> 05:13.940
Then that's my oversight.

05:14.860 --> 05:16.060
This is an archbishop

05:16.580 --> 05:17.780
that lost control three years ago.

05:18.620 --> 05:20.300
He took Sealed Artifact 0-08 and vanished.

05:20.340 --> 05:20.380
Wanted

05:20.340 --> 05:20.380
Order

05:20.340 --> 05:20.380
Ince

05:20.340 --> 05:20.380
Zangwill

05:21.100 --> 05:22.020
To this day he has yet to be discovered.

05:22.900 --> 05:23.820
The Holy Church's order

05:24.140 --> 05:26.020
is if you discover him, don't alert him and immediately make a report.

05:26.540 --> 05:27.100
Otherwise,

05:27.780 --> 05:29.140
you'll one thousand percent

05:29.740 --> 05:30.300
die in the line of duty.

05:34.180 --> 05:35.900
Sealed Artifact 0-08 is...

05:37.180 --> 05:38.340
A Grade 0 Sealed Artifact.

05:38.740 --> 05:39.980
The highest danger grade.

05:40.220 --> 05:41.380
The highest confidentiality.

05:42.020 --> 05:42.940
Not to be inquired about.

05:42.980 --> 05:43.780
Not to be disseminated.

05:44.180 --> 05:45.060
Not to be described.

05:45.300 --> 05:46.020
Not to be spied upon.

05:46.940 --> 05:47.860
Regarding 0-08,

05:48.500 --> 05:50.980
all I know is that it looks like a common quill pen.

05:51.420 --> 05:52.860
It doesn't require ink to write.

05:53.140 --> 05:53.620
Pen?

05:54.140 --> 05:55.620
After a Beyonder loses control and dies,

05:56.340 --> 05:58.740
they will leave behind things that are rich with Beyonder powers.

05:59.300 --> 06:00.180
If they cannot be controlled,

06:00.660 --> 06:01.780
they have to be sealed.

06:02.140 --> 06:03.780
This is one of the origins of Sealed Artifacts.

06:04.500 --> 06:05.340
Then what if

06:05.940 --> 06:06.620
they are controllable?

06:10.860 --> 06:12.420
You wouldn't want to know the answer.

06:13.620 --> 06:14.740
Whether it's a Nighthawk

06:14.980 --> 06:15.940
or a Mandated Punisher,

06:15.980 --> 06:16.900
Machinery Hivemind;

06:17.100 --> 06:18.100
they all will face losing control

06:18.300 --> 06:19.580
or sacrifice during a mission.

06:20.540 --> 06:20.980
Klein,

06:21.940 --> 06:22.900
you have to get used to it.

06:23.620 --> 06:24.340
Pull yourself together.

06:26.060 --> 06:26.620
I understand.

06:27.260 --> 06:27.660
Captain.

06:29.060 --> 06:29.860
The Captain is right.

06:30.300 --> 06:30.900
I should pull myself together.

06:31.620 --> 06:32.900
There's still a black hand behind the curtain to investigate.

06:33.340 --> 06:33.940
I still need to

06:34.540 --> 06:35.140
go home.

06:35.300 --> 06:35.780
Klein.

06:38.540 --> 06:39.340
I happened to buy some

06:39.820 --> 06:40.540
sweet iced tea.

06:41.580 --> 06:42.260
You liked this,

06:42.660 --> 06:43.100
right?

06:50.460 --> 06:50.980
Thank you.

06:52.300 --> 06:52.780
Captain.

06:54.180 --> 06:55.460
The things you applied for earlier

06:56.100 --> 06:56.940
came in today too.

06:58.020 --> 06:58.780
Tarot cards.

06:59.380 --> 07:00.340
A total of twenty-two cards.

07:01.260 --> 07:03.180
The card faces are inlaid with pure silver and other metal threads.

07:03.820 --> 07:05.620
Only has a restrictive effect on undead creatures.

07:06.860 --> 07:09.020
Why'd you suddenly think to use tarot cards as a weapon?

07:10.220 --> 07:11.380
Cards are more covert than guns.

07:12.220 --> 07:13.420
A weapon that's not like a weapon.

07:13.940 --> 07:15.300
Only at the critical moment can you

07:16.300 --> 07:17.140
deliver a fatal counter-attack.

07:23.420 --> 07:24.180
The power is sufficient.

07:24.740 --> 07:25.620
The accuracy is lacking a bit.

07:27.140 --> 07:27.820
No need to rush.

07:28.500 --> 07:30.500
From now on, I'll teach you combat and techniques for delivering force.

07:31.180 --> 07:32.380
Anything else you don't understand

07:32.820 --> 07:34.140
you can also ask me directly.

07:34.860 --> 07:36.060
You're already Sequence 8.

07:36.940 --> 07:37.900
You should have more

07:38.060 --> 07:39.500
knowledge about contact with the spiritual world.

07:40.460 --> 07:41.500
I've found a teacher for you.

07:42.340 --> 07:44.060
Tonight at around ten o'clock they'll come find you.

07:45.380 --> 07:46.980
A Sequence 6 Spirit Guide.

07:48.660 --> 07:49.420
Don't go to bed early.

08:07.620 --> 08:08.500
You're back, Klein.

08:08.780 --> 08:09.540
Have you had dinner?

08:10.220 --> 08:10.980
I already ate,

08:10.980 --> 08:11.500
Melissa.

08:14.620 --> 08:15.100
What's up.

08:16.620 --> 08:17.860
Right now you look like

08:18.340 --> 08:19.140
you're in better spirits.

08:20.820 --> 08:21.300
Sorry.

08:21.900 --> 08:22.780
I made you worry.

08:23.940 --> 08:24.300
Right!

08:24.740 --> 08:25.220
This.

08:26.060 --> 08:27.780
I recently transitioned to a full-time role in the police department.

08:28.060 --> 08:28.540
So...

08:30.340 --> 08:31.460
You got another raise!

08:33.260 --> 08:34.740
As expected, knowledge is wealth.

08:35.180 --> 08:36.540
Basic Accounting Theory?

08:37.180 --> 08:37.580
Benson,

08:38.020 --> 08:39.020
this is...

08:41.380 --> 08:43.060
I really don't hope in another five years

08:43.500 --> 08:44.820
that I'll still be making less than two pounds a week.

08:46.180 --> 08:47.300
It only <i>looks</i> very hypnotic.

08:47.860 --> 08:50.580
First study basic mathematical logic and relevant legal knowledge,

08:50.940 --> 08:52.020
it's helpful for studying accounting.

08:53.020 --> 08:53.420
Really.

08:54.060 --> 08:54.460
Without a doubt.

08:55.180 --> 08:55.580
Okay.

08:56.100 --> 08:56.860
I'll work hard

08:57.580 --> 08:58.220
studying.

08:58.500 --> 09:00.700
That's the biggest difference between humans and curly-haired baboons!

09:12.140 --> 09:14.860
This copper whistle was something I had with me when I woke up.

09:15.460 --> 09:16.940
It can summon my messenger.

09:17.540 --> 09:18.820
Find a relatively safe place,

09:18.940 --> 09:19.860
use some force and give it a blow,

09:20.460 --> 09:22.100
and the little guy will come out in a moment.

09:23.300 --> 09:24.300
Messenger...

09:32.700 --> 09:33.380
No sound.

09:34.260 --> 09:34.700
It's broken.

09:44.100 --> 09:44.820
What's going on?

10:05.500 --> 10:06.340
It's that.

10:07.140 --> 10:08.020
Mr. Azik.

10:08.700 --> 10:09.900
You call this a little guy?

10:39.460 --> 10:40.260
Madam Daly!

10:41.540 --> 10:43.420
I thought I'd be able to give you a big scare.

10:44.660 --> 10:46.820
Just then that messenger ulted from the get-go.

10:47.060 --> 10:49.220
Madam, what you did just now can only be considered a basic attack.

10:50.020 --> 10:51.620
As expected, you are the Spirit Guide.

10:52.340 --> 10:52.900
Madam Daly!

10:53.540 --> 10:54.620
Congratulations on your promotion to Sequence 6.

10:55.500 --> 10:57.820
I still prefer the name Spirit Medium.

10:58.420 --> 11:00.500
Today, I'll first teach you two Beyonder abilities.

11:01.060 --> 11:02.180
Summoning a messenger,

11:02.580 --> 11:04.460
and a different mediumship ritual.

11:04.860 --> 11:06.060
Using ritualistic magic,

11:06.220 --> 11:07.900
you can enter another person's Mind World

11:08.060 --> 11:10.420
and explore memories hidden deep within the subconscious.

11:12.020 --> 11:12.740
Usually,

11:13.020 --> 11:14.900
the existence of the human will

11:15.340 --> 11:18.300
resists unprotected communication between souls.

11:18.740 --> 11:20.100
So it can be quite troublesome.

11:20.580 --> 11:21.740
There are also quite a few

11:22.180 --> 11:22.820
dangers.

11:25.460 --> 11:26.620
In the Mind World,

11:26.900 --> 11:27.500
everything...

11:44.180 --> 11:44.820
Madam.

11:45.380 --> 11:46.780
Will today's knowledge be

11:47.100 --> 11:48.020
a bit too much?

11:49.980 --> 11:50.740
Captain!

11:53.460 --> 11:53.780
You――

11:53.780 --> 11:55.740
You're here to see Madam Daly, right?

11:56.460 --> 11:57.140
Don't mind him.

11:57.660 --> 11:58.700
Entering peoples' dreams to scare them <i>again</i>.

11:59.940 --> 12:00.620
Sorry, Daly.

12:01.300 --> 12:02.340
I interrupted your lesson.

12:03.100 --> 12:04.380
Remember you promised me

12:04.620 --> 12:06.020
red wine and a banquet.

12:09.820 --> 12:10.340
Klein.

12:10.780 --> 12:11.380
Bring your weapons,

12:11.900 --> 12:12.740
there's an urgent mission.

12:20.740 --> 12:20.780
Languages

12:20.740 --> 12:20.780
Ancient Hermes: Originates from nature, similar to Jotun, Dragonese, and Elvish, its effects are very direct and potent,
but lacks the necessary concealment and protection, easily getting its users caught up in danger.
Hermes: Developed because Ancient Hermes was considered too dangerous, it was modified to provide concealment and protection.
Ancient Feysac: Directly derived from Jotun, it was humanity's common language during the Fourth Epoch, and is the origin of
the writing systems and languages of the modern Northern Continent nations.
The current common human languages, Loen, Feysac, and Intis, all originate from Ancient Feysac.
——————《On the Evolution of Divine Languages》

12:29.780 --> 12:29.820
Tingen
Greenhill
Mental Asylum

12:39.020 --> 12:39.900
Hood Eugen.

12:39.300 --> 12:39.340
Spectator Pathway  Sequence 7  Psychiatrist

12:40.420 --> 12:42.420
He's been disguised as an ordinary citizen of Tingen.

12:43.100 --> 12:43.660
Recently,

12:43.940 --> 12:44.740
he suddenly went mad.

12:45.620 --> 12:47.220
A suspected Sequence 7 Psychiatrist

12:48.020 --> 12:49.580
who accidentally exposed his Beyonder abilities.

12:50.340 --> 12:51.980
His dreams are already a sea of chaos.

12:52.540 --> 12:53.900
It's no longer possible to conduct an interrogation with Nightmare.

12:55.260 --> 12:56.700
You try using a mediumship ritual.

13:02.060 --> 13:03.900
Psychiatrists are part of the Spectator Pathway.

13:04.260 --> 13:05.660
They have strong psychological defense mechanisms.

13:06.180 --> 13:06.700
Exercise caution.

13:10.900 --> 13:11.500
Have you slept?

13:13.780 --> 13:14.980
I haven't.

13:15.420 --> 13:16.460
I've been

13:16.460 --> 13:17.380
waiting for you.

13:17.580 --> 13:18.740
You knew I was coming.

13:19.620 --> 13:22.420
You said you'd bring me cake.

13:25.220 --> 13:26.420
<i>I</i> never promised you that.

13:27.780 --> 13:28.460
El.

13:29.020 --> 13:30.060
El said.

13:30.460 --> 13:32.980
He'd give me cake if I didn't sleep at night.

13:33.540 --> 13:34.340
He didn't.

13:34.900 --> 13:36.580
There's no cake.

13:38.620 --> 13:39.500
It's you.

13:40.180 --> 13:42.140
You stole my cake!

13:54.340 --> 13:55.340
Don't get so worked up.

13:59.660 --> 14:00.740
Nightmare.

14:12.700 --> 14:14.060
The Captain's Nightmare ability has been enhanced.

14:14.860 --> 14:16.940
It looks like the potion digestion has been going smoothly these past few days.

14:18.300 --> 14:18.900
Let's start,

14:19.300 --> 14:19.780
Klein.

14:23.460 --> 14:25.180
I pray for the power of the Evernight.

14:25.820 --> 14:27.540
I pray for the power of the mysterious.

14:28.300 --> 14:30.300
I pray for the Goddess' loving grace.

14:36.340 --> 14:37.420
I pray that you'll

14:37.980 --> 14:40.700
allow me to communicate with Hood Eugen's spirituality.

14:57.980 --> 14:58.860
So light.

15:00.100 --> 15:00.980
Yet so heavy.

15:02.420 --> 15:03.500
What sound is this?

15:22.500 --> 15:24.540
This is the Spirit World Madam Daly spoke of.

15:25.340 --> 15:26.660
Overlapping with the real world.

15:27.340 --> 15:29.380
The past, present, and future converge here.

15:30.180 --> 15:32.020
Innumerable information flows here.

15:33.580 --> 15:36.380
This leads to the entrance of Hood Eugen's Mind World.

16:15.100 --> 16:15.780
Tell me.

16:16.420 --> 16:17.140
Who are you.

16:17.900 --> 16:19.100
What organization are you from?

16:20.340 --> 16:22.020
Hood Eugen.

16:22.780 --> 16:23.740
Psychology

16:24.220 --> 16:25.500
Alchemists.

16:26.500 --> 16:27.620
Psychology Alchemists!

16:29.220 --> 16:30.460
Psychology Alchemists.

16:31.300 --> 16:32.820
What is their purpose in coming to Tingen?

16:38.980 --> 16:39.820
No response.

16:40.900 --> 16:41.900
Did I ask the wrong question,

16:42.580 --> 16:43.180
or

16:43.380 --> 16:44.380
is Eugen also unsure?

16:46.020 --> 16:47.100
Then who is El?

16:48.860 --> 16:49.980
El.

16:51.340 --> 16:53.220
Lanevus.

16:55.100 --> 16:55.940
Lanevus!

16:56.740 --> 16:58.660
Eugen remembers his cake even he's gone mad.

16:59.060 --> 17:00.420
The two must have a close relationship.

17:01.500 --> 17:03.220
That criminal who cheated both money and sex.

17:03.540 --> 17:04.900
It's very likely that he's also a Beyonder.

17:06.380 --> 17:06.940
Swindler.

17:07.420 --> 17:08.700
Could he be what the files referred to as

17:09.220 --> 17:10.660
a Marauder Pathway Sequence 8——

17:11.100 --> 17:11.860
—―Swindler?

17:13.020 --> 17:14.700
Why did Lanevus come looking for you?

17:15.340 --> 17:16.420
He said.

17:17.060 --> 17:19.060
You should be able to see!

17:19.660 --> 17:22.260
What the presence is behind me.

17:23.260 --> 17:26.940
And in some sense, the Psychology Alchemists

17:27.580 --> 17:29.820
definitely also have a connection to "Him",

17:30.900 --> 17:33.460
provided you only offer a little bit of help!

17:33.980 --> 17:36.660
You'll not only harness the power of the potion,

17:36.900 --> 17:39.140
but also the method to avoid losing control!

17:39.620 --> 17:44.060
You'll also get the divinity that Beyonders have always dreamed of.

17:44.740 --> 17:46.740
Immortal divinity!

17:47.300 --> 17:48.660
Hood Eugen.

17:48.780 --> 17:50.220
So long as you can seize the opportunity

17:50.580 --> 17:53.540
we can also become the rulers of this world!

17:54.660 --> 17:55.420
What's the meaning of this?

17:56.180 --> 17:57.740
A Swindler's characteristic style of speaking!

18:00.940 --> 18:01.940
What kind of help

18:02.340 --> 18:03.380
does Lanevus want you to provide?

18:06.220 --> 18:07.100
Help...

18:11.820 --> 18:12.580
Help...

18:13.100 --> 18:14.660
I provided help...

18:15.060 --> 18:16.780
I provided help...

18:16.860 --> 18:18.500
I provided help!

18:18.980 --> 18:19.900
I let...

18:59.500 --> 19:01.340
Eugen's spiritual sea has already collapsed.

19:02.020 --> 19:03.100
If I don't escape quickly...

19:31.860 --> 19:32.300
Shit!

19:41.420 --> 19:42.220
What happened?

19:43.020 --> 19:44.980
You almost got lost in his Mind World.

19:46.580 --> 19:46.980
Captain.

19:47.660 --> 19:49.060
I saw a gloomy altar.

19:49.540 --> 19:51.100
And a shadow resembling the True Creator.

19:52.620 --> 19:54.220
No wonder Eugen immediately lost control.

19:54.540 --> 19:55.860
A gloomy altar.

19:56.620 --> 19:58.300
If it's related to the True Creator

19:58.860 --> 20:00.660
then it's very likely also related to the Aurora Order.

20:01.460 --> 20:02.860
And the Psychology Alchemists

20:03.260 --> 20:04.420
may also be hidden behind it,

20:04.740 --> 20:06.180
tacitly allowing these events to unfold.

20:06.540 --> 20:07.220
Aurora Order.

20:08.620 --> 20:09.060
Captain.

20:09.580 --> 20:11.380
Do you still remember that letter written to Mr. Z?

20:12.020 --> 20:13.700
The letter that Aurora Order member Sirius carried.

20:15.380 --> 20:16.180
He mentioned in the letter

20:17.060 --> 20:18.140
that he was waiting for an appropriate opportunity,

20:18.500 --> 20:19.420
at the arrival of the end of days,

20:20.340 --> 20:21.500
to offer his so-called God

20:21.900 --> 20:23.660
all the lambs in Tingen.

20:25.780 --> 20:27.660
I think this is something that Lanevus planned.

20:28.180 --> 20:29.100
There's a deep connection.

20:33.860 --> 20:35.500
This situation may be rather serious.

20:38.740 --> 20:40.820
We must re-investigate Lanevus.

20:47.100 --> 20:47.140
South Borough
Steel Factory

21:05.260 --> 21:07.740
Wife of MP Maynard bellowed,

21:05.460 --> 21:05.500
John Maynard

21:05.460 --> 21:05.500
New Party Member

21:05.460 --> 21:05.500
Tingen Member of Parliament  Mayoral candidate

21:08.260 --> 21:10.540
"You shameless bitch."

21:13.340 --> 21:14.540
She's the murderer!

21:14.740 --> 21:16.140
Why are you not arresting her?!

21:17.020 --> 21:17.780
Madam Sharon.

21:17.020 --> 21:17.060
Sharon Khoy

21:17.020 --> 21:17.060
Baron Khoy's widow

21:18.140 --> 21:18.980
A famous socialite in Tingen.

21:19.540 --> 21:20.580
Baron Khoy's widow.

21:21.900 --> 21:24.060
These people are all members of the Conservative Party and the New Party.

21:24.500 --> 21:25.780
They have a close relationship

21:26.500 --> 21:27.260
with Madam Sharon.

21:29.700 --> 21:31.540
Beside her is the incumbent Baron Khoy.

21:31.940 --> 21:33.140
Madam Sharon's stepson.

21:34.500 --> 21:35.260
Stepson?

21:37.660 --> 21:38.620
I'm going to sue her!

21:38.540 --> 21:41.540
Mary Maynard

21:38.540 --> 21:41.540
Wife of MP Maynard

21:39.140 --> 21:40.860
I'm going to sue you police for dereliction of duty!

21:44.020 --> 21:45.220
These kinds of slutty whores

21:45.540 --> 21:47.260
deserve to be punished with a pear of anguish!

21:51.860 --> 21:52.820
Wife of the MP.

21:53.260 --> 21:53.300
Dennis

21:53.260 --> 21:53.300
Mayor of Tingen

21:53.660 --> 21:56.420
Your vulgar words are unbecoming of your position.

21:57.820 --> 22:01.100
I sent Madam Sharon to meet with MP Maynard last night.

22:01.620 --> 22:02.220
Do you

22:02.580 --> 22:04.380
have any problems with me?

22:24.780 --> 22:27.100
As expected of Tingen's most famous socialite.

22:40.820 --> 22:41.620
Let's go upstairs and take a look.

22:48.380 --> 22:49.380
John Maynard.

22:49.540 --> 22:50.300
New Party member.

22:50.580 --> 22:51.500
Tingen Member of Parliament,

22:51.540 --> 22:52.380
mayoral candidate.

22:53.380 --> 22:54.860
The initial autopsy report shows

22:55.100 --> 22:57.740
that the time of death was between nine and eleven last night.

22:58.780 --> 23:00.060
The corpse has not been moved.

23:00.660 --> 23:01.740
The butler discovered it this morning.

23:02.260 --> 23:04.700
Madam Sharon was the last person the MP met while he was alive.

23:05.700 --> 23:07.220
Ruling out the influence of supernatural factors,

23:07.500 --> 23:08.500
and also ruling out foul play,

23:09.300 --> 23:11.100
the initial verdict is death due to sudden illness.

23:11.900 --> 23:12.620
What did you find?

23:13.700 --> 23:14.500
Unanimous with Frye.

23:15.620 --> 23:16.300
But I think

23:16.740 --> 23:18.300
the death of this MP is not so simple.

23:18.940 --> 23:20.340
It's definitely related to supernatural factors.

23:21.500 --> 23:23.740
When I was searching for clues related to the Lanevus case,

23:24.260 --> 23:26.900
I discovered that Lanevus leased the South Borough Steel Factory.

23:27.580 --> 23:29.020
There's a hidden exchange of interests behind this.

23:30.340 --> 23:31.020
The one really in charge

23:31.700 --> 23:33.180
was a highly respected Member of Parliament.

23:34.260 --> 23:35.700
Mayoral candidate,

23:36.100 --> 23:37.460
John Maynard.

23:38.140 --> 23:40.220
He's the one I was going to focus today's investigation on.

23:40.980 --> 23:42.260
The time of death is too coincidental.

23:43.020 --> 23:45.180
Investigate deeper into Madam Sharon's social network.

23:45.740 --> 23:47.500
See if she has any connections to Lanevus.

23:57.380 --> 23:59.100
The death of John Maynard.

23:59.500 --> 24:01.420
The existence of supernatural influences.

24:04.540 --> 24:05.100
They exist!

24:05.980 --> 24:06.460
As expected.

24:07.060 --> 24:08.300
Our investigation was interfered with.

24:14.180 --> 24:16.220
Madam Sharon is a Beyonder.

24:21.020 --> 24:23.340
Madam Sharon and Lanevus are connected.

24:28.420 --> 24:29.300
I can't divine it.

24:30.100 --> 24:31.180
She's using a pseudonym.

24:31.980 --> 24:32.460
Or.

24:33.020 --> 24:34.460
She's a very powerful Beyonder.

24:35.460 --> 24:36.740
There's not enough genuine information.

24:37.260 --> 24:38.460
There's no way to verify anything else either.

24:39.420 --> 24:40.900
How many times have I been interfered with now?

24:41.460 --> 24:42.180
It's too coincidental, isn't it?

24:43.340 --> 24:43.980
Could it be that

24:45.460 --> 24:47.900
Madam Sharon is related to the black hand behind the curtain?

25:40.500 --> 25:45.460
Burn my broken shell to new sight

25:46.140 --> 25:53.820
To be free in mist to hold a cup of light

25:54.580 --> 25:57.940
Where are the flames that come in fury?

25:58.060 --> 26:01.460
Where are the keys that carve truth from me?

26:01.580 --> 26:07.140
Into the dark to dream and scream my name

26:07.180 --> 26:10.660
Wonder or dismay

26:10.660 --> 26:14.140
Madness or Decay

26:14.500 --> 26:16.140
With fragile light

26:16.140 --> 26:20.420
I vow to guard a world I stay

26:20.740 --> 26:24.220
Stirring or delay

26:24.460 --> 26:27.780
Rebirth or be same

26:28.260 --> 26:30.180
With whispers in grey

26:30.180 --> 26:33.740
Guide my shadow way

26:33.740 --> 26:37.020
Fade away

26:53.660 --> 26:53.700
Easter Egg

27:19.780 --> 27:19.820
City of Silver

27:45.380 --> 27:46.860
O Magnificent Deity.

27:48.220 --> 27:51.980
I am willing to dedicate my life to you.

27:59.540 --> 28:00.180
This is...

28:00.980 --> 28:01.900
a new prayer.

28:02.460 --> 28:03.140
Mr. Fool.

28:03.860 --> 28:05.220
I have some good news to share.

28:06.060 --> 28:07.340
Your aforementioned

28:07.620 --> 28:09.580
Higher Exam for selecting talent through public examinations,

28:10.020 --> 28:11.900
has already obtained the approval of both the King and the Prime Minister.

28:12.420 --> 28:13.380
Early next year, it's projected

28:13.620 --> 28:15.180
to enter the official implementation phase.

28:15.740 --> 28:16.380
So fast.

28:17.020 --> 28:18.500
It seems that Miss Justice's family

28:18.740 --> 28:19.820
has quite a bit of political influence.

28:21.420 --> 28:22.060
Very good.

28:24.700 --> 28:25.980
Honorable Mr. Fool.

28:26.420 --> 28:27.780
I also have a matter I'd like to consult you about.

28:28.900 --> 28:31.900
The Aurora Order has continuously been pursuing the holy residence of the True Creator.

28:32.260 --> 28:32.900
Whether

28:33.260 --> 28:35.140
it is the legendary Forsaken Land of the Gods.

28:35.500 --> 28:36.620
Forsaken Land of the Gods.

28:36.940 --> 28:38.380
It's related to the True Creator.

28:40.700 --> 28:43.500
What was Emperor Roselle looking for in the Forsaken Land of the Gods?

28:47.660 --> 28:50.100
This is not something you should know now.

28:52.260 --> 28:53.860
Please forgive me for overstepping my boundaries.

28:56.140 --> 28:57.020
You may continue.

29:01.580 --> 29:02.340
Miss Justice.

29:02.740 --> 29:03.940
I would like to ask you for a favor.

29:06.020 --> 29:06.780
What kind of favor?

29:07.460 --> 29:08.500
In Backlund,

29:09.100 --> 29:10.300
find the whereabouts of a person.

29:29.860 --> 29:30.540
This matter

29:30.860 --> 29:31.700
is high-risk.

29:32.420 --> 29:34.420
But to this end I will pay you the compensation you deserve.

29:36.380 --> 29:37.180
May I ask who to look for?

29:39.060 --> 29:40.580
One of the Seven Pirate Admirals,

29:41.900 --> 29:43.020
Vice Admiral Hurricane

29:44.140 --> 29:45.300
Qilangos.

29:50.660 --> 29:51.860
Seven Pirate Admirals.

29:53.300 --> 29:53.980
Speaking of which,

29:54.620 --> 29:56.020
he also went to Backlund.

30:14.020 --> 30:14.940
Mr. Fool.

30:15.580 --> 30:16.820
Could it be that he's performing a miracle?

30:23.100 --> 30:24.340
O Magnificent Deity.

30:25.020 --> 30:29.100
I am willing to use my blood to please you.

30:29.660 --> 30:30.740
What language is this?

30:31.580 --> 30:33.540
The root language of Loenese, Ancient Feysac!

30:34.900 --> 30:35.540
Not exactly.

30:36.020 --> 30:38.340
Please allow us, the People of the Dark, to be freed from the curse of our destiny.

30:39.980 --> 30:40.820
It seems to be

30:41.700 --> 30:42.460
Jotun!

30:43.060 --> 30:44.700
O Magnificent Deity.

30:45.380 --> 30:47.660
Please bestow the sun and light once more upon this land that you have forsaken.

30:47.980 --> 30:49.020
It really is Jotun!

30:49.740 --> 30:50.980
Fortunately I've learned a bit.

30:51.820 --> 30:53.900
Where in the world is Jotun still used?

30:54.700 --> 30:57.340
This is an ancient antique that is thousands of years old.

30:58.100 --> 30:59.460
Magnificient Deity.

31:00.220 --> 31:01.860
A land that was forsaken.

31:03.660 --> 31:04.860
Forsaken Land of the Gods.

31:32.500 --> 31:32.540
Derrick Berg

31:50.780 --> 31:51.260
You——

31:53.300 --> 31:53.820
Your Grace,

31:54.620 --> 31:55.700
are you God?

31:56.260 --> 31:57.500
I am not God.

31:58.220 --> 31:59.340
I am merely someone

31:59.580 --> 32:01.460
interested in the long history of this world,

32:02.380 --> 32:03.140
The Fool.

32:04.900 --> 32:05.740
The Fool.

32:08.660 --> 32:09.300
Justice.

32:10.980 --> 32:11.820
The Hanged Man.

32:16.340 --> 32:17.300
Choose a card, then.

32:18.300 --> 32:19.660
It will serve as your codename.

32:35.460 --> 32:36.220
I choose

32:39.700 --> 32:40.340
The Sun!
